{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06242","headline":"同王右丞送瑗公南归 · 崔兴宗","name":"同王右丞送瑗公南归","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"行苦神亦秀，泠然谿上松。\n铜瓶与竹杖，来自祝融峯。\n常愿入灵岳，藏经访遗踪。\n南归见长老，且爲说心胸。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔兴宗","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06242.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06242","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}